
---
import DocsLayout from '/src/layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
import DocsCode from '/src/components/DocsCode.astro';
---

<DocsLayout title="Lua & LSL Docs">
<div class="dashboard summary-function">
  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`ll.InsertString(TargetVariable: string, Position: number, SourceVariable: string): string`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`string llInsertString(string TargetVariable, integer Position, string SourceVariable);`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Returns the string <b>dst</b> with <b>src</b> inserted starting at <b>pos</b>.</p>
</p>
      <table class="param-table" id="parameters">
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>string</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>string</span></td>
          <td>TargetVariable / dst</td>
          <td>destination of insertion</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>number</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>integer</span></td>
          <td>Position / <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Parameters/pos" target="_blank">pos</a></td>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>It's 1 based</span>position index for insert, first is 0</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>string</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>string</span></td>
          <td>SourceVariable / src</td>
          <td>source string to be inserted</td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Categories</div>
      <ul class="meta-list">
        <li>string</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Tech Specs</div>
      <div class="tech-item"><span class="tech-label">Energy</span><span class="tech-val">10</span></div>
      <div class="tech-item"><span class="tech-label">LSO ID</span><span class="tech-val">96</span></div>

      <div class="label-stack">
        <span class="attr-label bg-pure">Side-Effect Free</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
  <p><b>pos</b> <i>does not</i> support <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Negative_Index" target="_blank">negative indexes</a>.</p>
  <p>i.e. unlike other somewhat similar string functions such as <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlGetSubString" target="_blank">llGetSubString</a> and <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlDeleteSubString" target="_blank">llDeleteSubString</a>, you cannot use -1 for the counting with this function. You may use instead the function provided a bit further below.</p>
  <h2>Caveats</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>If <b>pos</b> is out of bounds the script continues to execute without an error message.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Examples</h2>
<div class="lua-block"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`ll = llcompat

ll.InsertString("input", 2, "put out")  -- returns "input output"`} lang="slua" /></div>
<div class="lsl-block"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`llInsertString("input", 2, "put out")// returns "input output"`} lang="lsl" /></div>
  <h2>Useful Snippets</h2>
  <p>This function will allow you to use a negative number as the position:</p>
<div class="lua-block"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`ll = llcompat

local function insertString(destination, position, str)
    if position < 0 then
        if ((function() position += ll.StringLength(destination) return position end)()) < 0 then
            position = 0
        end
    end
    return ll.InsertString(destination, position, str)
end
`} lang="slua" /></div>
<div class="lsl-block"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`string insertString(string destination, integer position, string str) {
    if (position < 0)
        if ((position += llStringLength(destination)) < 0)
            position = 0;
    return llInsertString(destination, position, str);
}`} lang="lsl" /></div>
